<title>SPAIN: DSL bank issues 10-year 10 bln pta matador.</title>
<headline>DSL bank issues 10-year 10 bln pta matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Siedlungs und Landesrentenbank (DSL) Bank is launching a 10 billion pesetas 10-year matador bond at 101 percent, BNP Espana said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The bond has a fixed coupon at 6.67 percent for the first five years. Then, it pays a reverse float at 12.80 percent minus the 12-month Libor with a floor at 4.5 percent.</p>
<p>Payment date is March 20, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
